    "text": "I thought you would understand the letter. Then I thought another letter would lead someone here. Each explanation made the next day of silence easier to justify. I frightened you because I was frightened, and because being useful felt safer than admitting I needed help. I can explain it. I cannot turn that explanation into something you owed me.",
